<title>USA: AMBAC qualifies two issues for bond insurance.</title>
<headline>AMBAC qualifies two issues for bond insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMBAC Indemnity Corp said it qualified for insurance two bond issues slated for competitive sale on Wednesday.</p>
<p>--Carpinteria USD, Calif., $4 million of general obligation bonds (GOS).</p>
<p>--Asbury Park Board of Education, N.J., $12.9 million of school bonds.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
